cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this work using the release you consulted."
type: software
title: "Class-group exponent seven in imaginary quadratic fields and orders"
authors:
  - family-names: "nunavipahe60-star"
    website: "https://github.com/nunavipahe60-star"
  - name: "Claude"
  - name: "Gemini"
  - name: "Codex"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A computer-assisted classification of the 33 imaginary quadratic fields and
  40 imaginary quadratic orders of class-group exponent seven under Dirichlet
  GRH. The release contains the proof, Fourier certificates, two trace-sieve
  implementations, an independent two-prime divisor search, and the verified
  table of order discriminants. The repository author coordinated the work
  with Claude, Gemini and Codex. The claims ledger records the review status.
keywords:
  - imaginary quadratic fields
  - quadratic orders
  - class groups
  - Dirichlet L-functions
  - computational number theory
